sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Browser
    participant A as API
    participant DB as MongoDB

    U->>A: POST /api/auth/refresh (cookie is sent by the browser)
    A->>DB: find the session by SHA-256(cookie)

    alt no session found
        A-->>U: 401, clear the cookie
    else session is already ROTATED (an old token came back)
        A->>DB: revoke EVERY session with the same familyId
        A->>DB: write auditLog REFRESH_REUSE_DETECTED
        A-->>U: 401 "please log in again"
    else session is ACTIVE and not expired
        A->>A: make a new refresh token
        A->>DB: old row becomes ROTATED, new row is ACTIVE, same familyId
        A-->>U: 200 new accessToken + new refresh cookie
    end
